  "description": {
   "en": "Can you form a life-changing bond with somebody overnight? It’s a question Sejoon has never imagined he’d have to ask himself, but here he is. He’s spent his entire life as an omega with an innate disgust for alphas, which has only grown since he was forced into prostitution by his own cousin. Yet when he accidentally spends a passionate night with Taeheon, a gruff but thoughtful alpha, they immediately form a bond that’s deeper than anything either of them have experienced before. But is this connection meant to last for only an instant? Or will it last for a lifetime?"
  },
